      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, it\u0027s been the API, but it\u0027s a bad API that we should change. I just did a quick Code Search and find many wrong usages ([1](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:art/oatdump/oatdump.cc;l\u003d806;drc\u003da60b8c1f6f5539de4c8f464c1eaa11242ffb8729), [2](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:art/oatdump/oatdump.cc;l\u003d1962;drc\u003da60b8c1f6f5539de4c8f464c1eaa11242ffb8729), [3](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:art/odrefresh/odrefresh.cc;l\u003d194;drc\u003da60b8c1f6f5539de4c8f464c1eaa11242ffb8729), [4](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:art/compiler/utils/assembler_test_base.h;l\u003d215;drc\u003da60b8c1f6f5539de4c8f464c1eaa11242ffb8729), [5](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:art/dex2oat/linker/oat_writer.cc;l\u003d3421;drc\u003da60b8c1f6f5539de4c8f464c1eaa11242ffb8729), [6](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:art/libartbase/base/unix_file/fd_file.cc;l\u003d653;drc\u003da60b8c1f6f5539de4c8f464c1eaa11242ffb8729)). This makes me think we should deprecate that API and use the new one instead.\n\nI jsut added a comment to that API that it\u0027s deprecated. Ideally we should add [[deprecated]], but it would generate too many warnings, so I\u0027m not going to do that ATM.",
